OL,3,GNEWSATurtle doves released in bid to
OL,4,Astop extinction
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists have released more
OL,7,Fthan two dozen turtle doves in the
OL,8,FSouth Downs National Park in a bid to
OL,9,Fhelp the species, which is on the brink
OL,10,Fof extinction in the UK, to recover.
OL,12,FThe dove, famous for its place in the
OL,13,FTwelve Days of Christmas song, is the
OL,14,Fcountry's fastest declining bird
OL,15,Fspecies according to the RSPB.
OL,17,FIn an attempt to boost population
OL,18,Fnumbers, the national park authority
OL,19,Freleased 30 birds in the Selborne area
OL,20,Fof Hampshire this spring.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
