OL,3,GNEWSATurtle doves released in bid to
OL,4,Astop extinction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said the plan was part of
OL,7,F"urgent efforts" to restore the
OL,8,Fspecies, with a further 100 doves being
OL,9,Fprepared for another release next year.
